{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#card-zh","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuzz 是面向 DSH 的差分测试规划插件，通过 Host 工具 fuzz 将请求规划和结果处理委托给随包提供的 Python 引擎。它可以从响应中提取带类型的字段值，基于请求和种子生成测试计划，运行计划并汇总响应差异，还可对 JSON 指定路径做状态核验并分类结果。另提供环境检查和目标业务映射读写。适合需要在 DSH 工作流中整理和比较 HTTP 测试结果的开发者。需要 Node.js 22.19+（或 24+）及 Python 3.9+，可配置工作区、Python 路径和引擎位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-19","index.js:203-218","engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:346-379","engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:847-913"]}
{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#card-en","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fuzz adds a DSH tool for planning HTTP tests and reviewing results. It extracts typed response values, builds plans from requests and seeds, compares JSON paths, and summarizes differences. It suits developers organizing repeatable HTTP checks. Requires Node.js 22.19+ (or 24+) and Python 3.9+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-19","index.js:203-218","engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:346-379","engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:847-900"]}
{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#intent-1","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"我想从 HTTP 响应里自动整理出字段和值，后续用来构造测试输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:346-379"]}
