{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#feature-1","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuzz 的功能「响应字段提取」：从提供的 JSON 响应中收集字段名和值并识别值类型，也能从非 JSON 文本中提取常见值。调用 fuzz 工具的 harvest 动作，结果保存为种子文件并返回字段和类型摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:346-379"]}
{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#feature-2","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuzz 的功能「测试计划生成」：根据 HTTP 请求、参数和种子值生成差分测试计划，可选择不同计划类别并限制候选数量。调用 fuzz 工具的 plan 动作，计划写入工作区的计划目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:600-715"]}
{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#feature-3","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuzz 的功能「计划运行」：读取已有计划并调用随包引擎处理，生成包含差异记录的运行结果目录；支持限制单次处理的计划数量，也可使用 dryRun。通过 fuzz 工具的 run 动作触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:717-845"]}
{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#feature-4","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuzz 的功能「差异与状态归类」：读取运行目录中的 diffs.csv 和 state.csv，将记录归为差异、状态变化或其他结果，并汇总数量。调用 fuzz 工具的 verdict 动作查看分类摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["engine/fuzz/fuzz_ops.py:847-900"]}
{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#feature-5","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuzz 的功能「JSON 结构比较」：比较两个 JSON 对象的节点类型、值与容器大小，可忽略指定路径或只观察选定路径。该比较逻辑由引擎调用，用于生成语义差异记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["engine/diffprobe/dp_semantic.py:35-72"]}
{"unit_id":"rannyrjjy__dsh-fuzz#caveat-1","repo":"rannyrjjy/dsh-fuzz","commit":"c500ce10d2779449de1cdff9959dba76bbd4c368","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fuzz 使用前须知：运行数据和证据目录位于配置的本地工作区；默认工作区为 DSH Host 当前目录，可通过 workspaceDir 或 DSH_FUZZ_WORKSPACE 指定。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-15","index.js:168-171"]}
